    {"symbol": "🚰", "tooltip": "Both sides argue over who mops the floor while ignoring who left the tap running — the upstream tax subsidy toward capital."},
    {"symbol": "🏭", "tooltip": "The 'engine' isn't an abstraction — it's compute and energy owned by a handful of firms, which is where a robot tax can't reach."}
  ],
